{"title":"IQOS Terea Cigarette","description":"\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"iqos-terea-bronze","title":"IQOS Terea Bronze","description":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eTerea Bronze - Rich, warm taste experience. A mild, aromatic tobacco blend with notes of cocoa and dried fruits. \u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNote:\u003c\/strong\u003e For use with IQOS Iluma devices only.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe innovative heating technology in new IQOS Iluma devices is the Smartcore Induction System that heats the tobacco from within the new Terea Smartcore stick. These newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThese bladeless devices offer a cleaner way to heat tobacco from the core, without burning it, to provide a more consistent experience, no tobacco residue, and no need to clean the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAdditionally, they generate no combustion and no smoke, and PMI’s market research indicates that IQOS ILUMA provides a more pleasurable experience compared to previous IQOS generations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41673628549175,"sku":"Terea Bronze - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41673628581943,"sku":"Terea Bronze - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos-terea-bronze.jpg?v=1747872097"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-yellow","title":"IQOS Terea Yellow","description":"\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eTerea Yellow - Mildly spicy taste experience. A mild, aromatic tobacco blend with light, spicy aroma notes. \u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNote:\u003c\/strong\u003e For use with IQOS Iluma devices only.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe innovative heating technology in new IQOS Iluma devices is the Smartcore Induction System that heats the tobacco from within the new Terea Smartcore stick. These newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThese bladeless devices offer a cleaner way to heat tobacco from the core, without burning it, to provide a more consistent experience, no tobacco residue, and no need to clean the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAdditionally, they generate no combustion and no smoke, and PMI’s market research indicates that \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\" title=\"Iqos\"\u003eIQOS \u003c\/a\u003eILUMA provides a more pleasurable experience compared to previous IQOS generations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41673628614711,"sku":"Terea Yellow - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41673628647479,"sku":"Terea Yellow - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/terea-yellow-for-iqos-iluma.jpg?v=1750033763"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-amber","titl