\n\u003cp\u003eThe innovative heating technology in new IQOS Iluma devices is the Smartcore Induction System that heats the tobacco from within the new Terea Smartcore stick. These newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese bladeless devices offer a cleaner way to heat tobacco from the core, without burning it, to provide a more consistent experience, no tobacco residue, and no need to clean the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, they generate no combustion and no smoke, and PMI’s market research indicates that \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\" title=\"Iqos\"\u003eIQOS \u003c\/a\u003eILUMA provides a more pleasurable experience compared to previous IQOS generations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41710172602423,"sku":"Terea Blue - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41710172635191,"sku":"Terea Blue - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/terea-blue-for-iqos-iluma.jpg?v=1750034433"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-sienna","title":"IQOS Terea Sienna","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIQOS Terea Sienna - Balanced, woody taste experience. A well-rounded, roasted tobacco blend with woody notes and subtle tea aromas.\u003c\/span\u003e For use with IQOS Iluma devices only.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe innovative heating technology in new IQOS Iluma devices is the Smartcore Induction System that heats the tobacco from within the new Terea Smartcore stick. These newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese bladeless devices offer a cleaner way to heat tobacco from the core, without burning it, to provide a more consistent experience, no tobacco residue, and no need to clean the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, they generate no combustion and no smoke, and PMI’s market research indicates that \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\" title=\"Iqos devices\"\u003eIQOS\u003c\/a\u003e ILUMA provides a more pleasurable experience compared to previous IQOS generations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41710173454391,"sku":"Terea Sienna - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41710173487159,"sku":"Terea Sienna - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/terea-sienna-for-iqos-iluma.jpg?v=1750034594"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-green","title":"IQOS Terea Green","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIQOS Terea Green has a menthol freshness stronger than Turquoise, enhanced by green, minty aroma notes.\u003c\/span\u003e For use with IQOS Iluma devices only.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe innovative heating technology in new IQOS Iluma devices is the Smartcore Induction System that heats the tobacco from within the new Terea Smartcore stick. These newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese bladeless devices offer a cleaner way to heat tobacco from the core, without burning it, to provide a more consistent experience, no tobacco residue, and no need to clean the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, they generate no combustion and no smoke, and PMI’s market research indicates that \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\" title=\"Iqos devices\"\u003eIQOS\u003c\/a\u003e ILUMA provides a more pleasurable experience compared to previous IQOS generations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41710173782071,"sku":"Terea Green - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41710173814839,"sku":"Terea Green - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/terea-green-for-iqos-iluma.jpg?v=1750034790"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-purple-wave","title":"IQOS Terea Purple Wave","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIQOS Terea Purple Wave (Mauve Wave) has a rich fruity flavor with refreshing menthol and a mild forest fruit aroma.\u003c\/span\u003e For use with IQOS Iluma devices only.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, they generate no combustion and no smoke, and PMI’s market research indicates that \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/iqos-heets\" title=\"Iqos devices\"\u003eIQOS\u003c\/a\u003e ILUMA provides a more pleasurable experience compared to previous IQOS generations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41710179811383,"sku":"Terea Purple Wave - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41710179844151,"sku":"Terea Purple Wave - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/terea-purple-wave-for-iqos-iluma.jpg?v=1750034939"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-berrine-edition","title":"IQOS Terea Berrine Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003eTerea Cigarette Berrine Edition -Cooling and floral tobacco sensation with Indonesian cloves. A blend of fine tobacco with Indonesian cloves and refreshing cooling menthol enriched with fruity and floral aromas.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, they generate no combustion and no smoke, and PMI’s market research indicates that IQOS ILUMA provides a more pleasurable experience compared to previous IQOS generations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41763726131255,"sku":"Terea Berrine Edition - Pack","price":900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41763726164023,"sku":"Terea Berrine Edition - Carton","price":7500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos_terea_stick_berrine_edition_cigarette.webp?v=1751932813"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-emerald-edition","title":"IQOS Terea Emerald Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/terea-cigarette\" title=\"Terea cigarette\"\u003eTerea Cigarette\u003c\/a\u003e Emerald Edition - This flavour can become a real gem of your tobacco collection. You will especially like it if you prefer soft, minty freshness without a strong menthol hit. The whole ensemble is complemented by notes of fresh fruits. There is no unnecessary sweetness in the taste. Each stick is designed for about 14 puffs or 6 minutes of smoking.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavour of Terea Emerald Edition Indonesia: Fresh fruity and minty scent.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41764568727607,"sku":"Terea Emerald Edition - Pack","price":900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41764568760375,"sku":"Terea Emerald Edition - Carton","price":7500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS-Terea-Emerald-Edition.webp?v=1751933276"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-black-green","title":"IQOS Terea Black Green","description":"\u003cp\u003eIQOS TEREA Black Green is a revolutionary way to enjoy tobacco - intense menthol cooling sensation complemented by a mellow tobacco blend and highlighted with green fruit aromas. With no smoke or ash, you can enjoy a smoother and more satisfying tobacco experience every time. Heat-not-burn technology ensures harmful chemicals and tar are eliminated from your experience. Get your own \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/terea-cigarette\" title=\"Iqos Terea\"\u003eIQOS TEREA\u003c\/a\u003e Black Green today!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41764571742263,"sku":"Terea Black Green - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41764571775031,"sku":"Terea Black Green - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos-terea-cigarette-Black-Green-pack.webp?v=1751933460"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-bright-wave","title":"IQOS Terea Bright Wave","description":"\u003cp\u003eIQOS TEREA Bright Wave offers an extraordinary tobacco experience with deep menthol cooling sensations and green fruit and fresh aromas. Enjoy the same taste and satisfaction of smoking, but without the smoke and ash thanks to our heat-not-burn technology, which eliminates harmful chemicals and tar. Get a smoother, more enjoyable tobacco experience with \u003ca title=\"Iqos Terea\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/terea-cigarette\"\u003eIQOS TEREA\u003c\/a\u003e Bright Wave!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/terea-cigarette\" title=\"Terea Stick\"\u003eTerea stick\u003c\/a\u003e is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41764576952375,"sku":"Terea Bright Wave - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41764576985143,"sku":"Terea Bright Wave - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos-terea-cigarette-bright-wave-pack.webp?v=1751933770"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-yugen-dimensions","title":"IQOS Terea Yugen Dimensions","description":"\u003cp\u003eIQOS TEREA Dimensions Yugen is the perfect device for a unique and satisfying smoking experience. Carefully crafted with a special blend of tobacco, ripe fruit and floral aromas, the device heats rather than burns resulting in a cleaner and smoother smoking. Enjoy the unique mix of sensations for a truly enjoyable experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the \u003ca title=\"Terea Stick\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/terea-cigarette\"\u003eTerea stick\u003c\/a\u003e is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41764577902647,"sku":"Terea Yugen Dimensions - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41764577935415,"sku":"Terea Yugen Dimension - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/terea-cigarette-dimensions-yugen.webp?v=1751934043"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-mulint-edition","title":"IQOS Terea Mulint Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003eFlavour of Terea Cigarette Mulint Edition: Mint and mulberry scent combined with cloves.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach Terea Mulint Edition ILUMA cigarette comes with a structure equivalent to a traditional cigarette. Users can use the product within 6 minutes. That is, users can use it with 14 continuous puffs. However, this number is only an estimate because each person will have a different time to inhale the cigarette. However, \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/terea-cigarette\" title=\"Terea Indonesia cigarette\"\u003eTerea Indonesia cigarettes \u003c\/a\u003eare still highly appreciated in terms of dosage and usage time.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe product will appeal to users who love unusual flavour solutions. Moderately sweet and refreshing, it is perfectly complemented by quality Indonesian tobacco. We offer original high-quality sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41764580130871,"sku":"Terea Mulint Edition - Pack","price":900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41764580163639,"sku":"Terea Mulint Edition - Carton","price":7500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS-Terea-cigarette-Mulint-Edition.webp?v=1751934515"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-golden-edition","title":"IQOS Terea Golden Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003eFlavour of Terea Golden Edition: Traditional nutty and woody aroma.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach Terea Golden Edition ILUMA cigarette comes with a structure equivalent to a traditional cigarette. This flavour is called golden for its excellent balance and harmony. The combination of aromatic Indonesian tobacco, nut and wood notes creates a wonderful smoking experience, transporting the user to the atmosphere of a languid evening. This taste will be appreciated by all lovers of the classics.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePrefer it if you consider fruit and berry aromas too sweet.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41764583276599,"sku":"Terea Golden Edition - Pack","price":900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41764583309367,"sku":"Terea Golden Edition - Carton","price":7500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos-terea-cigarette-golden-edition-pack.webp?v=1751935248"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-zing-wave","title":"IQOS Terea Zing Wave","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eTEREA ZING WAVE brings a refreshing new dimension to the world of \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eterea\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003e. Designed exclusively for IQOS ILUMA, this flavor combines crisp menthol with a zing of citrus, offering a cool yet energetic sensation with every puff.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--EndFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41838501724215,"sku":"Terea Zing Wave - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41838501756983,"sku":"Terea Zing Wave - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos-terea-Zing-Wave.jpg?v=1755831419"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-turquoise","title":"IQOS Terea Turquoise","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTurquoise Terea are intended for use with the IQOS ILUMA device and have a mild tobacco mix flavour with a spicy menthol finish. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--EndFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41838507098167,"sku":"Terea Turquoise - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41838507130935,"sku":"Terea Turquoise - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS-TEREA-Turquoise-carton.webp?v=1755831770"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-silver","title":"IQOS Terea Silver","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSilver Terea: Balanced blend of toasted tobacco, delicately refined with light aromatic notes of spicy herbs. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--EndFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed sticks are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41880919900215,"sku":"Terea Silver - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41880919932983,"sku":"Terea Silver - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/terea-silver-for-iqos-iluma.webp?v=1758179129"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-summer-wave","title":"IQOS Terea Summer Wave","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTerea Summer Wave (Coral Tide) has an aromatic fruity flavor of ripe peach with floral notes and mild menthol freshness. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--EndFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/terea-cigarette\" title=\"Terea cigarette\"\u003eterea cigarettes\u003c\/a\u003e are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41880934514743,"sku":"Terea Summer Wave - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41880934547511,"sku":"Terea Summer Wave - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/terea-summer-wave-cigarette.webp?v=1758179638"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-sun-pearl","title":"IQOS Terea Sun Pearl","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet to know Terea Sun Pearl, where fruity and fresh meets sophisticated. Perfect for the modern palate, whether you’re at home or on the go. With its convenient packaging and compatibility with most devices, Terea Sun Pearl is more than just a product; it’s a lifestyle for flavor lovers in the Kenya.\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--EndFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed \u003ca title=\"Terea cigarette\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/terea-cigarette\"\u003eterea cigarettes\u003c\/a\u003e are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41969798283319,"sku":"Terea Sun Pearl - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41969798316087,"sku":"Terea Sun Pearl - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS-Terea-Sun-Pearl-indonesia-for-pods.webp?v=1762191553"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-starling-pearl","title":"IQOS Terea Starling Pearl","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTEREA Starling Pearl offer a smooth tobacco experience with a refined combination of strawberry and basil flavors. The menthol capsule inside enhances the taste, delivering a refreshing, cool sensation with every puff.\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--EndFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese newly designed \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/terea-cigarette\" title=\"Terea cigarette\"\u003eterea cigarettes\u003c\/a\u003e are to be used only with IQOS Iluma, which features an auto-start function that detects when the Terea stick is inserted and automatically turns on the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":41973864071223,"sku":"Terea Starling Pearl - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41973864103991,"sku":"Terea Starling Pearl - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/starling-pearl-terea-iqos-cigarette-pack.webp?v=1762191726"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-minago-edition","title":"IQOS Terea Minago Edition","description":"\u003cp\u003eEnter a new world of tobacco with IQOS TEREA Minago Edition. With the spicy warmth of Indonesian cloves, invigorating cold menthol and fresh green-mint aromas, this TEREA stick is like nothing you’ve ever had before. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":42010891059255,"sku":"Terea Minago Edition - Pack","price":900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":42010891092023,"sku":"Terea Minago Edition - Carton","price":7500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS_TEREA_Sticks_Indonesia_10_packs_Minago_Edition.webp?v=1764776849"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-oasis-pearl","title":"IQOS Terea Oasis Pearl","description":"\u003cp\u003eTerea Oasis Pearl combines a mild tobacco blend with a subtle, exotic fruity note and a hint of menthol. The result is a smooth, balanced taste experience with a hint of holiday – ideal for those who like it pleasantly fresh and not too intense.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese SMARTCORE STICKS™ have been specially developed for IQOS ILUMA devices and contain an integrated metal heating element. This ensures even heat distribution without combustion – for a clear taste and less odour. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":42010892140599,"sku":"Terea Oasis Pearl - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":42010892173367,"sku":"Terea Oasis Pearl - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/terea-oasis-pearl-pack.webp?v=1764777105"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-apricity","title":"IQOS Terea Apricity","description":"\u003cp\u003eIndulge in the luxurious blend of flavors with the Terea Apricity Dimension, a premium tobacco product that combines the rich taste of tobacco with the subtle sweetness of apricot, the creamy hints of vanilla, and the smooth finish of caramel. This unique flavor profile is designed to cater to discerning smokers looking for a sophisticated smoking experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: Exclusively compatible with IQOS ILUMA, ensuring a seamless and enjoyable experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":42010894729271,"sku":"Terea Apricity - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":42010894762039,"sku":"Terea Apricity - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/terea-apricity-iqos-cigarette-pack.webp?v=1764777933"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-twilight-pearl","title":"IQOS Terea Twilight Pearl","description":"\u003cp\u003eTwilight Pearl TEREA IQOS sticks are a capsule-style heated tobacco option made for adult smokers using the IQOS ILUMA range. TEREA is designed for ILUMA’s SMARTCORE Induction System™, where tobacco is heated rather than burned — so there is no smoke and no ash during use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTwilight Pearl starts with a full-bodied, toasted tobacco blend with malty aroma notes. When you want a change of pace, you can click the pearl (flavour capsule) in the filter to release a cooling blueberry and menthol sensation.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility note: TEREA sticks are designed to be used only with IQOS ILUMA devices and are not compatible with blade-based IQOS models (including IQOS 3 DUO and earlier). This product contains nicotine, which is addictive, and is strictly 18+ only. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":42079672762423,"sku":"Terea Twilight Pearl - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":42079672795191,"sku":"Terea Twilight Pearl - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS-Terea_Twilight-Pearl.webp?v=1769148513"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-tidal-pearl","title":"IQOS Terea Tidal Pearl","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover Terea Tidal Pearl, a sophisticated edition from the Terea range for the IQOS Iluma system. This stick offers a harmonious blend of sweet, woody, and floral notes, designed for a refined, smoke-free tobacco experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePerfect for lovers of delicate tastes, Tidal Pearl offers a subtle balance, ideal for everyday use or for varying the pleasures.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility note: TEREA sticks are designed to be used only with IQOS ILUMA devices and are not compatible with blade-based IQOS models (including IQOS 3 DUO and earlier). This product contains nicotine, which is addictive, and is strictly 18+ only. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":42079680823351,"sku":"Terea Tidal Pearl - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":42079680856119,"sku":"Terea Tidal Pearl - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/IQOS-Terea-Tidal-Pearl.webp?v=1769149071"},{"product_id":"iqos-terea-provence-pearl","title":"IQOS Terea Provence Pearl","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover TEREA tobacco sticks, made exclusively for IQOS ILUMA heated tobacco device. Using the innovative SMARTCORE INDUCTION SYSTEM™, TEREA paired with IQOS ILUMA bring you next level heated tobacco experience with improved draw, taste consistency and less smell*, according to most consumers. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTerea Provence - Grape Menthol Tobacco Flavour\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 carton contains 200 sticks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"PACK","offer_id":42110545461303,"sku":"Terea Provence Pearl - Pack","price":860.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":42110545494071,"sku":"Terea Provence Pearl - Carton","price":7250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/terea-provence-pearl.webp?v=1771186658"}],"url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/terea-cigarette.oembed","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




